66	 *  proof threshold is refused (see {@link CheckProofs}), so it never goes to PENDING. Opening, settling
67	 *  and voiding are refused to a role the sheet's permission matrix does not allow it. A SETTLED claim
68	 *  may be voided only by a steward, and only within {@link #VOID_SETTLED_DAYS} days of the sheet's today
