678	 *  OPEN claim of the same date and note, numbered next in the period of its own due-by (see {@link Numbering}), opened by the user, due by
679	 *  the business day its person's own terms (else their grade's in force on that date, else the sheet's then) after its date, fixed
680	 *  now (a late entry when the period that due-by falls in is soft-closed), and logged as OPEN by the user. Refused when another user moved the claim on first. */
681	public class ApplySplit {
